{"type":"text","timestamp":"2026-09-26T22:17:55.978Z","data":{"text":"Done. Summary of the work:\n\n**Added `src/core/status/leftover-drafts.ts`** — `findLeftoverDrafts` finds active checkout folders whose `hashChangeFolder` still matches the `.run/approved` the default branch holds under `<archive>/<folder>`, using the first `changeTrees` tree, `vcs.show`, and `changesDirLabel`. It returns `[]` when `vcs.enabled` is off or git is unavailable.\n\n**Changed `src/core/status/status.ts`** — added optional `leftovers` to `StatusOverview`, filtered leftover folder names out of `specs`, and printed the `Leftover drafts:` section between pending verifications and `Archived specs:`.\n\n**Added `tests/status-leftover.test.ts`** — 7 tests through `statusCommand` on temporary git repos covering every scenario of the delta (hand landing, worktree removed, edited copy, unlanded, removal clears flag, flag off, no git).\n\n**Changed `README.md`** — listed `osq message <id>` under Commands and documented the hand-landing flow, the leftover flag, and worktree-based scenario lookup in the Version control section.\n\nBoth the task verify (`node --import tsx --test tests/status-leftover.test.ts`) and the proposal verify (`pnpm verify`) pass. Result written to `openspec/changes/095-osq-message-and-leftovers/.run/results/3.md`."}}
